sequenceDiagram
    participant N1 as Node 1
    participant N2 as Node 2
    participant N3 as Node 3

    Note over N1, N3: 0 - Initialize models with the same W_active and W_anchor

    par
        Note over N1, N3: 1 - Distributed training
        N1->>N1: Update W_active with gradients
        N2->>N2: Update W_active with gradients
        N3->>N3: Update W_active with gradients
    end

    par
        rect rgba(200, 220, 255, 0.1)
            Note over N1, N3: 2.1 - Node 1 hits Sync interval
            N1->>N1: Delta = top_k( W_active - W_anchor )
            N1->>N2: Send Delta (1->2)
            N2->>N2: W_active, W_anchor += α*Delta
            N2->>N3: Relay α*Delta (2->3)
            N3->>N3: W_active, W_anchor += α²*Delta
            N3-->>N1: Relay α²*Delta (3->1)
            N1-->>N1: Ignore delta generated by self
        end

        Note over N1, N3: 2.2 - Node 2 hits Sync interval

        Note over N1, N3: 2.3 - Node 3 hits Sync interval
    end

      Note over N1, N3: 3 - Continue distributed training until the next sync interval

